            "Stage 17: characterises the debug module address region (alias of 0x0004_1000 onto the data SRAM, stale read data at an unmapped offset equal to 0x00100073, a fake halted state caused by normal code, recovery with ndmreset, and a full reset with dmactive = 0); these known limitations are checked against fixed expected values.",
